 user one iteration&#xa;Observe 5 · execute 10 iterations" style="shape=document;boundedLbl=1;html=0;convertToSvg=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#9E9E9E;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#212121;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;verticalAlign=middle;align=center" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1320" y="552" width="200" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="19" value="Active User Simulator&#xa;Acts first each turn&#xa;Current-state tools only&#xa;Accept · reject · or gather context" style="ellipse;html=0;convertToSvg=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#E3F2FD;strokeColor=#1976D2;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#212121;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;verticalAlign=middle;align=center" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="800" y="552" width="200" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="20" value="Assistant Observe Mode&#xa;Receive user action and notifications&#xa;Read-only tools&#xa;Wait or propose assistance" style="rounded=1;arcSize=20;html=0;convertToSvg=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#E3F2FD;strokeColor=#2196F3;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#212121;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;verticalAlign=middle;align=center" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="544" y="552" width="200" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="21" value="Proposal Outcome?&#xa;Accept · reject · gather&#xa;Or task end / turn limit" style="rhombus;html=0;convertToSvg=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#FFF3E0;strokeColor=#FF9800;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#212121;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;verticalAlign=middle;align=center" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="280" y="552" width="200" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="22" value="Assistant Execute Mode&#xa;Complete cross-app flat API&#xa;Perform approved task only&#xa;Then begin the next user turn" style="rounded=1;arcSize=20;html=0;convertToSvg=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#E3F2FD;strokeColor=#2196F3;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#212121;f